<title>USA: The Limited names V. Ann Hailey CFO.</title>
<headline>The Limited names V. Ann Hailey CFO.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Limited Inc said Wednesday that V. Ann Hailey had been named chief financial officer, a post held by Vice Chairman Kenneth Gilman since 1987.</p>
<p>Hailey, who was also named executive vice president, was chief financial officer for the Pillsbury Co division of Grand Metropolitan Plc before joining the Limited, the company said.</p>
<p>She will report directly to Gilman, who was named chief administrative officer in addition to retaining his title as vice chairman.</p>
</text>
